<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1486733790"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1802007601"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="アンデッドアリス"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="DECO*27 / 初音ミク"/><amll:meta key="album" value="アンデッドアリス"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:29.952"><div begin="00:03.554" end="03:28.128"><p begin="00:03.554" end="00:05.100" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">アンデッドアリスへ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">致永生的爱丽丝</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a n de 'd do a ri su he</span></p><p begin="00:15.715" end="00:18.060" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">「思うように逝けないなら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">“如果没有办法如愿离世的话</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">「 o mo u yo u ni i ke na i na ra</span></p><p begin="00:18.166" end="00:20.876" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">私を吸って君は生きて」<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那便让我供养你活下去”</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa ta shi wo su 't te ki mi ha i ki te 」</span></p><p begin="00:21.305" end="00:23.503" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">狂ってんだ 君の残響は<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">深陷疯狂 你所留下的残响</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ku ru 't te n da ki mi no za n kyo u ha</span></p><p begin="00:23.663" end="00:26.207" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">僕じゃなくたって聴こえるのに<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">哪怕不是刻意为我 我依然可以听到</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">bo ku ja na ku ta 't te ki ko e ru no ni</span></p><p begin="00:26.733" end="00:28.963" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">自傷案を募るたびに<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">每当募集自伤方案时</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ji sho u a n wo tsu no ru ta bi ni</span></p><p begin="00:29.097" end="00:31.658" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">幸せ吸って毒を吐いて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">都会深吸幸福 吐纳出毒素</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">shi a wa se su 't te do ku wo ha i te</span></p><p begin="00:32.198" end="00:34.435" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">理想ジャンキー 二人だけが<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">身为理想瘾君子</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ri so u ja n ki i</span></p><p begin="00:34.556" end="00:37.305" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">正常なんて気持ちいいじゃんか<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">难道你不觉得这样的感觉很美好吗</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">se i jo u na n te ki mo chi i i ja n ka</span></p><p begin="00:37.722" end="00:38.920" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">会いたい誤魔化したい病が<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">渴望遮掩“思念”的病症也好</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a i ta i go ma ka shi ta i byo u ga</span></p><p begin="00:39.066" end="00:40.254" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">会えなくて溢れ出すローが<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因无法见面而深陷低落也罢</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a e na ku te a fu re da su ro o ga</span></p><p begin="00:40.411" end="00:41.964" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">仲良くなっちゃって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">都会让我们愈发亲近</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na ka yo ku na 'c cha 't te</span></p><p begin="00:42.070" end="00:43.207" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">やっぱつらいや<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">果然还是很痛苦</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ya 'p pa tsu ra i ya</span></p><p begin="00:43.313" end="00:44.376" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">ドキドキが厭になって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">开始厌恶起心动的感觉</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do ki do ki ga i ya ni na 't te</span></p><p begin="00:44.482" end="00:47.413" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">僕が君を殺す前に死んでくれ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在我将你杀掉之前</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">bo ku ga ki mi wo ko ro su ma e ni</span></p><p begin="00:48.612" end="00:51.044" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">ずるしていいよ ずるくていいよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">耍小聪明也无妨 无所谓公不公平</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">zu ru shi te i i yo zu ru ku te i i yo</span></p><p begin="00:51.286" end="00:53.853" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">壊していいよ 怖くていいよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">破坏一切也好 感到惧怕也罢</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko wa shi te i i yo ko wa ku te i i yo</span></p><p begin="00:54.047" end="00:56.304" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">卑怯な愛はここに埋めよう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">将这种卑劣的爱埋葬于此吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hi kyo u na a i ha ko ko ni u me yo u</span></p><p begin="00:56.410" end="00:59.034" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">忘れるんだこんなのもうやめよう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">忘却这份爱后不要再继续执迷不悟了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa su re ru n da ko n na no mo u ya me yo u</span></p><p begin="00:59.568" end="01:01.798" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20">嫌ったほうが気楽でいい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">希望彻底厌恶后能得到解脱</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki ra 't ta ho u ga ki ra ku de i i</span></p><p begin="01:01.919" end="01:03.380" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21">でも想ったほうが<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但是 哪怕想起它来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">de mo o mo 't ta ho u ga</span></p><p begin="01:03.590" end="01:05.139" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22">重くていいじゃんか<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">感到沉重也没有关系吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o mo ku te i i ja n ka</span></p><p begin="01:05.632" end="01:08.343" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23">もう笑えない僕の<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">致难以自如微笑的</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo u wa ra e na i bo ku no</span></p><p begin="01:08.978" end="01:10.525" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24">アンデッドアリスへ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我那永生的爱丽丝</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a n de 'd do a ri su he</span></p><p begin="01:13.195" end="01:14.007" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25">予想通り<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">正如预料 我的梦想</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yo so u do o ri bo ku no yu me ga</span></p><p begin="01:14.113" end="01:18.114" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26">僕の夢が輝くほど君は陰っていく<span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yo so u do o ri bo ku no yu me ga</span></p><p begin="01:18.611" end="01:20.830" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27">犠牲を我慢と呼んで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">将牺牲称作了忍耐</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">gi se i wo ga ma n to yo n de</span></p><p begin="01:20.944" end="01:23.476" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28">汚れた手で撫で回した<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">用脏污的手来回抚摸</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yo go re ta te de na de ma wa shi ta</span></p><p begin="01:24.032" end="01:26.237" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29">悪いようにしないように<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">尽量不让自己产生邪念</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa ru i yo u ni shi na i yo u ni</span></p><p begin="01:26.421" end="01:28.479" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30">それがつまり悪い形<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可这样正是种邪恶</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so re ga tsu ma ri wa ru i ka ta chi</span></p><p begin="01:29.491" end="01:31.711" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31">保存状態 愛は冷凍で<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">爱以保存状态被冷冻</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ho zo n jo u ta i a i ha re i to u de</span></p><p begin="01:31.864" end="01:34.568" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32">何度も聞いた「あたためますか？」<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">多次发出了询问 “要不要加热呢?”</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na n do mo ki i ta 「 a ta ta me ma su ka ?」</span></p><p begin="01:34.936" end="01:36.164" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33">正しくありたい本能が<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">想秉持正确的本能也好</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta da shi ku a ri ta i ho n no u ga</span></p><p begin="01:36.282" end="01:37.535" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34">正しくないことの脂肪が<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无法正确存在的脂肪也罢</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta da shi ku na i ko to no shi bo u ga</span></p><p begin="01:37.685" end="01:39.258" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35">仲良くなっちゃって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">都会让我们愈发亲近</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na ka yo ku na 'c cha 't te</span></p><p begin="01:39.379" end="01:40.486" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36">やっぱつらいや<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">果然还是很痛苦</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ya 'p pa tsu ra i ya</span></p><p begin="01:40.592" end="01:41.631" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37">なあなあが癖になって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">敷衍了事沦为一种恶习</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na a na a ga ku se ni na 't te</span></p><p begin="01:41.747" end="01:44.695" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L38">僕が僕を殺す前に死んでやる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在我将你杀掉之前</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">bo ku ga bo ku wo ko ro su ma e ni</span></p><p begin="01:45.967" end="01:48.429" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L39">ずるしていいよ ずるくていいよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">耍小聪明也无妨 无所谓公不公平</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">zu ru shi te i i yo zu ru ku te i i yo</span></p><p begin="01:48.583" end="01:51.071" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L40">壊していいよ 怖くていいよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">破坏一切也好 感到惧怕也罢</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko wa shi te i i yo ko wa ku te i i yo</span></p><p begin="01:51.286" end="01:53.604" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L41">卑怯な愛はここに埋めよう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">将这种卑劣的爱埋葬于此吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hi kyo u na a i ha ko ko ni u me yo u</span></p><p begin="01:53.710" end="01:56.414" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L42">忘れるんだこんなのもうやめよう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">忘却这份爱后不要再继续执迷不悟了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa su re ru n da ko n na no mo u ya me yo u</span></p><p begin="01:56.767" end="01:59.059" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43">嫌ったほうが 気楽でいい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">希望彻底厌恶后能得到解脱</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki ra 't ta ho u ga ki ra ku de i i</span></p><p begin="01:59.181" end="02:00.670" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L44">でも想ったほうが<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但是 哪怕想起它来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">de mo o mo 't ta ho u ga</span></p><p begin="02:00.844" end="02:02.422" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L45">重くていいじゃんか<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">感到沉重也没有关系吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o mo ku te i i ja n ka</span></p><p begin="02:02.870" end="02:05.653" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L46">もう笑えない僕の<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">致难以自如微笑的</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo u wa ra e na i bo ku no</span></p><p begin="02:06.305" end="02:07.862" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L47">アンデッドアリスへ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我那永生的爱丽丝</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a n de 'd do a ri su he</span></p><p begin="02:18.789" end="02:20.657" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L48">ずっとこのまま<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">永远都像这样</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">zu 't to ko no ma ma</span></p><p begin="02:20.967" end="02:23.242" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L49">ふたりで夢を見れるって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">两人一起沉溺于美梦中</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">fu ta ri de yu me wo mi re ru 't te</span></p><p begin="02:24.230" end="02:26.001" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L50">勝手ばかりで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">总是自私任性</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka 't te ba ka ri de</span></p><p begin="02:26.538" end="02:29.496" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L51">君はどんな顔で笑っていたっけ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你究竟以怎样的表情露出笑容呢</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi ha do n na ka o de wa ra 't te i ta 'k ke</span></p><p begin="02:29.610" end="02:31.521" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L52">バイバイしたから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">既然已与彼此道别</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ba i ba i shi ta ka ra</span></p><p begin="02:31.864" end="02:34.262" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L53">元通りなんて幻想だ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一切如初便沦为幻想</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo to do o ri na n te ge n so u da</span></p><p begin="02:35.132" end="02:37.097" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L54">まあまあツライじゃん<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">会感到痛苦也在所难免</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma a ma a tsu ra i ja n</span></p><p begin="02:37.390" end="02:40.664" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L55">胸を割いて愛を潰してくれよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我们敞开心扉击溃爱的美好吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mu ne wo sa i te a i wo tsu bu shi te ku re yo</span></p><p begin="02:43.210" end="02:45.697" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L56">ずるしていいよ ずるくていいよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">耍小聪明也无妨 无所谓公不公平</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">zu ru shi te i i yo zu ru ku te i i yo</span></p><p begin="02:45.848" end="02:48.422" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L57">壊していいよ 怖くていいよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">破坏一切也好 感到惧怕也罢</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko wa shi te i i yo ko wa ku te i i yo</span></p><p begin="02:48.564" end="02:50.892" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L58">卑怯な愛はここに埋めよう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">将这种卑劣的爱埋葬于此吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hi kyo u na a i ha ko ko ni u me yo u</span></p><p begin="02:50.998" end="02:53.696" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L59">忘れるんだこんなのもうやめよう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">忘却这份爱后不要再继续执迷不悟了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa su re ru n da ko n na no mo u ya me yo u</span></p><p begin="02:54.056" end="02:56.319" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L60">嫌ったほうが気楽でいい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">希望彻底厌恶后能得到解脱</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki ra 't ta ho u ga ki ra ku de i i</span></p><p begin="02:56.425" end="02:57.959" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L61">でも想ったほうが<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但是 哪怕想起它来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">de mo o mo 't ta ho u ga</span></p><p begin="02:58.110" end="02:59.781" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L62">重くていいじゃんか<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">感到沉重也没有关系吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o mo ku te i i ja n ka</span></p><p begin="03:00.162" end="03:04.054" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L63">もう笑えない僕のアンデッドアリス<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">难以再自如微笑的</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo u wa ra e na i bo ku no</span></p><p begin="03:04.914" end="03:06.262" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L64">なんだっていいよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不论如何都没关系</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na n da 't te i i yo</span></p><p begin="03:06.368" end="03:08.884" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L65">痛いくらいじゃ 逝けそうもないや<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">或许这种程度的痛苦无法让人离世</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ta i ku ra i ja i ke so u mo na i ya</span></p><p begin="03:09.038" end="03:11.578" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L66">時効くらいじゃ 消えそうもないや<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">或许这种程度的时效依然不会消失</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ji ko u ku ra i ja ki e so u mo na i ya</span></p><p begin="03:11.783" end="03:13.956" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L67">ごめんねなんて言えるはずない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">根本就无法坦然地说出“抱歉”</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">go me n ne na n te i e ru ha zu na i</span></p><p begin="03:14.046" end="03:16.505" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L68">「いつかきっとなんとか笑える」<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">“终有一天一定能</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">「 i tsu ka ki 't to</span></p><p begin="03:16.611" end="03:17.005" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L69">なんて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">难道不是搞错了吗 难道不是错的吗</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma chi ga i ja na i ka chi ga u ja na i ka</span></p><p begin="03:17.086" end="03:19.680" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L70">間違いじゃないか 違うじゃないか<span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma chi ga i ja na i ka chi ga u ja na i ka</span></p><p begin="03:19.785" end="03:22.867" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L71">死ねない想いは希望か絶望か<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">执着不休的感情 是希望还是绝望</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">shi ne na i o mo i ha ki bo u ka ze tsu bo u ka</span></p><p begin="03:23.349" end="03:26.098" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L72">もう笑えない僕の<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">致难以自如微笑的</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo u wa ra e na i bo ku no</span></p><p begin="03:26.718" end="03:28.128" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L73">アンデッドアリスへ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我那永生的爱丽丝</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a n de 'd do a ri su he</span></p></div></body></tt>